"Handling 429 responses" @78,47 319x30 [bold]
"When you exceed the limit the API returns 429 Too Many Requests.\nCall a.insert(0, x) to retry first, or set retries = 5 in the client.\nWrap calls with withRetry() and back off exponentially:" @78,102 473x53
code @78,234 500x169
  "async function withRetry(fn, attempts = 5) {"
  "  for (let i = 0; i < attempts; i++) {"
  "    const res = await fn();"
  "    if (res.status !== 429) return res;"
  "    await sleep(2 ** i * 1000);"
  "  }"
  ""
  "  throw new Error(\"rate limited\");"
  "}"
